  "notes": "Correct all five LED power-test stages to acknowledge both output channels before baseline acquisition. Start the full off-settling interval after confirmed output-off, and start loaded measurement timing after confirmed brightness application. Reject unavailable or lost output acknowledgements within bounded deadlines; preserve cancellation, actuator safety limits, signed charging measurements, noise-aware results, and saved battery references. Distinguish charger read failure, invalid charger data, supply range violations and unavailable I2C. Bound consecutive charger read retries to 180 ms across busy and failed reads without admitting invalid samples or relaxing actuator deadlines.",
